  "texts": [
    {
      "spokenText": "Ana arrive au restaurant à vingt heures.",
      "textSHA256": "88cfcb01553716d9685b34347632026b6fba7a0dc710ed0b12797b8f9bc9d714",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Ana vérifie l'addition : le pourboire n'est pas compris.",
      "textSHA256": "99bb6955112a3d429902e8be0678dbaf91c924eb0b2e3e03a4b8467b66b00633",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bien sûr, des fruits à la place du dessert, pas de problème.",
      "textSHA256": "bd5c91ac3416f00177f2671435f35b0fb0af7c5784cf62d03d0cff3e10e84b56",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir, madame. Suivez-moi, votre table est prête. Voici la carte.",
      "textSHA256": "eed327a1bfd635221e72af44b0542da60c10a52633ab9018197f56063a26ff7d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Bonsoir. J'ai une réservation au nom d'Ana.",
      "textSHA256": "d90b43a5f250f2ee76cf4980da9e7f694c5a4d4559367809ca86834b41b7a9ee",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "En entrée, je prends la soupe.",
      "textSHA256": "606666dc52727994a6dd22710c0e4c5e0ae63a39a2da9e23f62b9d7e847f7daf",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "En entrée, je prends la soupe. En plat principal, je prends le poisson avec un verre de vin blanc.",
      "textSHA256": "7df87081a2a0954c5c526dc9a2d9b623c64740a1f95e2179bd3a835ed2744d50",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "En plat principal, je prends le poisson avec un verre de vin blanc.",
      "textSHA256": "a7519c12dba57152a09e0cea538825eae9ea140302e924b2fa66ebe46877adcc",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Est-ce que ce plat contient des fruits à coque ?",
      "textSHA256": "846be0e2e27c9b1539f515d0267211036b8c45ba7c36fbd52f706689da6f3a46",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Est-ce que je peux remplacer le dessert par des fruits ?",
      "textSHA256": "da925f3ad80131a5f0daa30db9cd12f1319cb26dcf7e933055dcc2ea29a245ba",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 12
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Est-ce que vous utilisez les mêmes poêles ?",
      "textSHA256": "b5ef46d1380da21aaf6e9931c0aa7bb9a35dbaec6ee8c909438924538a40e59f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "J'ai une réservation au nom d'Ana.",
      "textSHA256": "ad0f029ec4873144dbf710d2c771a9b3e595f51eb815791e6243be6443f9c009",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je suis allergique aux fruits à coque.",
      "textSHA256": "96e39140393dfe408e279c269c82c1c3e21d8ec8a0a13444fabc7ce2edb479ca",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je suis allergique aux fruits à coque. Est-ce que ce plat contient des fruits à coque ? Et est-ce que vous utilisez les mêmes poêles ?",
      "textSHA256": "ecc4998c957cb9518b15ebd97de1d160ac22d63fa4644a1c398782959c57403b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je voudrais payer par carte bancaire.",
      "textSHA256": "92f4661e4393bebc61bc5175d92eded239bcdc272a67e6f7535b1592119d5861",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le pourboire est-il compris ?",
      "textSHA256": "b10caa211963a96037e7c6ce046a9c39b0c6a1b74febb9cd07b16aa3a7f1c8ee",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le serveur va voir le chef, puis revient à la table.",
      "textSHA256": "bccf79ffb90c6020a0b5fd236b91c0821610a3c1516b878f11d0a4185774f8ee",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Oui, ce plat contient des fruits à coque, mais le chef va le préparer sans fruits à coque, dans une poêle propre.",
      "textSHA256": "b2cd59e5959fc2b7830b60a8ea460820405a741c66d80fca8f8f1006f23071bb",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 11
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Pourriez-vous m'apporter l'addition, s'il vous plaît ?",
      "textSHA256": "bf4b0e138c3eac6f4b00d4de0e2dd52ac53dcec70fc1cbb5ebb81c124c72e86d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 14
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Très bien, bonne soirée.",
      "textSHA256": "6b5802174a0a56acf1967ee87d0a9c0a6d85d076493cd71f8a3bc58ba7f6e81c",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "allergique",
      "textSHA256": "3f949b73999934941c006c171ff055eb9aa8446f6728bd199a76c43f2ecadf4e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:15:fr-en",
